control: At the end of a unit of work each token source's current refresh token is handed to the account snapshot library, and a failed write-back ends the run in an error
removes: the run returns without calling the hand-over, so no source's token reaches the database
packages: ./backfill
tests: TestARunHandsEveryAccountOverWhenItsWorkEnds
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

diff --git a/backfill/main.go b/backfill/main.go
